<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - NTT raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NTT raised.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research</p>
<p>Ltd upgraded Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp to a</p>
<p>&quot;A&quot; from its previous &quot;B&quot;, Daiwa Securities brokers said</p>
<p>on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute</p>
<p>assigns an &quot;A&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees outperforming</p>
<p>the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than</p>
<p>10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
